# Model files and intermediate artefacts: large, and reproducible from source.
artifacts/
*.tflite
*.keras
*.h5

# The prepared images (95 MB) stay out, but the manifests and split statistics
# that describe them do not: they are a few hundred KB, they are what the
# integration notebook reads to show the split, and without them a fresh clone
# cannot even see which images were dropped as leaked without re-running the
# whole preparation step.
data/prepared/*
!data/prepared/manifest_trainval.csv
!data/prepared/manifest_test.csv
!data/prepared/removed.csv
!data/prepared/stats.json

# Results are kept: CSVs and figures are small and feed straight into the report.
!results/
